0258_p0506a01","n":"0506a","t":"此結示休夏也言示現安居者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X10n0258_p0506b01","n":"0506b","t":"界蕩然一空則與一切融為一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X10n0258_p0506c01","n":"0506c","t":"初攝心先歸一息依息出入為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X10n0258_p0507a01","n":"0507a","t":"業障者乃夙習種子今脩行時"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X10n0258_p0508a01","n":"0508a","t":"脩福慧殊非小福薄德之人可"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X10n0258_p0508b01","n":"0508b","t":"為守護國界之主意列三界諸"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X10n0258_p0508c01","n":"0508c","t":"故皆大歡喜信受奉行圓覺經"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X10n0258_p0509a01","n":"0509a","t":"門一超直入是所謂法界之真"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X10n0258_p0509b01","n":"0509b","t":"照夜自漢徵宵夢華徙胡像八"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X10n0258_p0509c01","n":"0509c","t":"憨師婆心最熱佛願克弘特付"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-X-X10n0258-圓覺經直解","source":"CBETA X10n0258 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":90,"unit":"X10 頁欄"}